              "REV.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.1+EXO.30.2+EXO.30.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 30:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Malaika mar'aucel okudho gwara pere, t'awinjo dwondi jo m'owok i tungi migam aŋwen ma zahabu m'ocungo ruwaŋ Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwondi jo no owaco ri malaika mar'aucel man gi gwara no ni, “Gony jomalaika aŋwen m'otwey jo dho jwom madwoŋ m'ilwoŋo ni Yufrete!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo ogony jomalaika aŋwen no, m'onwaŋo otiek yiko jo kicutho ri sawa, gi ndelo, gi dwe, gi oro mere, ma neko acel wiy adek ma thotho pa ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaci ran welo pa lwak jolweny ma joŋweco gi kayina, obedo kiti miya ario (milion miya ario). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka i menyirok no aneno kayina kodi wegi mere ama: Oyido joruko kwot ma nyweny i kor gin, m'obokere pa mac, m'oliewa kodi manyatongweno pa salufa. Wic kayina no jocale wic simbwor, aka i dhok gin owok mac, yiro, kodi buru salufa ma moko mac i kibiriti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thoyamo adek me, mac, yiro, kodi buru salufa ma moko mac i kibiriti ma jowok i dhok kayina no oneko woko acel wiy adek ma thotho pa ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato meni pa kayina no nitie i dhok gin, kodi i yiw gin bende. Yiw gin ocale thwol, man gi wic, aka jooro gigipiny no ma kelo litho kwoŋ ji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
